#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:13
msgid ""
"We take the protection of your personal data seriously. This website "
"processes personal information in accordance with the General Data "
"Protection Regulation (GDPR) and applicable German and European data "
"protection laws."
msgstr ""
"我们高度重视您的个人数据保护。本网站根据《通用数据保护条例》(GDPR) 以及适用的"
"德国和欧洲数据保护法律处理个人信息。"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:16
msgid "Data We Collect"
msgstr "我们收集的数据"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:18
msgid ""
"When you place an order, contact us through a form, or create an account, we "
"may collect your name, email address, billing and shipping information, and "
"details necessary to process your request."
msgstr ""
"当您下订单、通过表单联系我们或创建账户时，我们可能会收集您的姓名、电子邮箱地"
"址、账单和配送信息，以及处理您的请求所需的详细信息。"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:21
msgid "Purpose of Processing"
msgstr "处理目的"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:23
msgid ""
"Personal data is processed solely for the purpose of providing our services, "
"fulfilling orders, responding to inquiries, maintaining security, and "
"complying with legal obligations."
msgstr ""
"个人数据的处理仅限于提供我们的服务、履行订单、回复咨询、维护安全以及遵守法律"
"义务的目的。"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:26
msgid "Payments"
msgstr "支付"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:28
msgid ""
"Payments are processed through trusted third-party payment providers. We do "
"not store complete payment card information on our servers."
msgstr ""
"支付通过受信任的第三方支付服务商处理。我们不会在服务器上存储完整的支付卡信"
"息。"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:31
msgid "Data Storage"
msgstr "数据存储"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:33
msgid ""
"Personal data is stored only for as long as necessary to fulfil contractual, "
"legal, or operational requirements and is deleted when no longer needed."
msgstr ""
"个人数据的存储时间仅限于满足合同、法律或运营要求所需的期限，并在不再需要时予"
"以删除。"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:36
msgid "Your Rights"
msgstr "您的权利"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:38
msgid ""
"Under the GDPR, you have the right to access, correct, restrict, delete, or "
"transfer your personal data, as well as the right to object to certain "
"processing activities."
msgstr ""
"根据GDPR，您有权访问、更正、限制、删除或转移您的个人数据，并有权反对某些处理"
"活动。"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:41
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "联系方式"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:43
msgid ""
"For questions regarding privacy or data protection, please use the contact "
"form available on this website."
msgstr "如有关于隐私或数据保护的问题，请使用本网站提供的联系表单。"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\private_policy.html:47
msgid "Last updated:"
msgstr "最后更新时间："

#: .\shop\templates\shop\terms.html:9
msgid "Last updated: November 2026"
msgstr "最后更新时间：2026年11月"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\terms.html:12
msgid "Acceptance of Terms"
msgstr "接受条款"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\terms.html:14
msgid ""
"By accessing and using HEARTH Shop, you accept and agree to be bound by the "
"terms and provision of this agreement."
msgstr "通过访问和使用 HEARTH Shop，您接受并同意受本协议条款和规定的约束。"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\terms.html:17
msgid "Products and Orders"
msgstr "产品与订单"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\terms.html:19
msgid ""
"All orders are subject to availability and confirmation of the order price. "
"We reserve the right to refuse any order placed with us."
msgstr ""
"所有订单均须视供应情况及订单价格确认而定。我们保留拒绝向我们下的任何订单的权"
"利。"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\terms.html:22
msgid "User Accounts"
msgstr "用户账户"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\terms.html:24
msgid ""
"If you create an account on the website, you are responsible for maintaining "
"the security of your account and you are fully responsible for all "
"activities that occur under the account."
msgstr ""
"如果您在网站上创建账户，您有责任维护您账户的安全，并对在该账户下发生的所有活"
"动承担全部责任。"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\terms.html:27
msgid "Contact Information"
msgstr "联系信息"

#: .\shop\templates\shop\terms.html:29
msgid ""
"If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us via our "
"contact page."
msgstr "如果您对这些条款有任何疑问，请通过我们的联系页面与我们联系。"

